# extra-packages.txt — extra apt packages to bake into YOUR OpenCode image.
#
# Copy this file to `extra-packages.txt` (gitignored) and list one apt package
# per line. start.sh installs them with `apt-get` at BUILD time on your host —
# which has normal internet, it does NOT go through the runtime Squid proxy —
# then bakes them into a thin LOCAL image layered on top of the pulled base.
# The locked-down runtime is unchanged: no new egress, no root for `dev`.
#
# Blank lines and lines starting with `#` are ignored. An empty or absent
# extra-packages.txt turns the feature off entirely (no extra build, current
# behaviour exactly).
#
# Example (uncomment to use):
# cmake
